{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "a1bb63ab-c77e-5a2d-8ae4-8bb88982e506",
  "Description": "Three forces turn 300 boxes into a whirlwind.\n\nEach [RigidForce] is one ingredient: a Vortex spins the boxes around the vertical axis, a Radial force pulls them back to the centre, and a Directional force lifts them against gravity. All three go into the Forces input of [PhysicsWorld].\n\nAKA: tornado, wind, swirl, forces, field\n\nTips\n- Switch a force to Field and connect a vector field, for example the Vectors output of [VolumeToField].\n- Turn on IsImpulse and pulse Trigger to kick the boxes once instead of pushing them all the time.",
